From 405586ac9ca9d8bc6a6f5125b313697192029432 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 13:00:00 +0300
Subject: test: update operation IDs for fetched ref state

Persisting fetched refs changes repository-view serialization and
therefore the operation IDs captured by snapshot tests. Refresh affected
expectations without changing their tested behavior

